 "rationale": {
  "NC2-07": "Architect ruling A1: a real OS-level process kill is a MANDATORY row. Expected outcome is the pinned code's own contract (Runtime c5e97e87 local_authority_effect.execute_claim_atomic single SQLite transaction + reconcile_claim_exact), not an invented recovery: nothing recovers the caller's acknowledgement; the destination state decides.",
  "NC3-04": "Architect ruling A2: dedicated mandatory row for operation-ledger pruning, not NC3-03 by substitution. Documented limitation preserved: Control Plane has no retention rule; protection is the destination-side operation guard only."
 }
